{"3836440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HEAVENSHATTER", "steam_appid": 3836440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HEAVENSHATTER</strong> is a first-person 3d roguelike set in a distant post-post-post apocalyptic world, beyond matters and means. You are a mass of decaying limbs and microorganisms, emerged from the earth by a brutal, screeching roar. As you roam sandy desolate fields and ancient ruins, your goal is to charge two pillars to activate the great teleporter and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>artifacts</strong> from the creatures you kill and make yourself a <strong>horrific walking fortress</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836440/extras/dd917cfbba9b3fbc678f2d1caad33fc4.poster.avif?t=1774259042\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836440/extras/dd917cfbba9b3fbc678f2d1caad33fc4.webm?t=1774259042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836440/extras/dd917cfbba9b3fbc678f2d1caad33fc4.mp4?t=1774259042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight extreme, brain-melting <strong>bosses</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836440/extras/9c11046c0b74afb5379004c135b5b187.poster.avif?t=1774259042\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836440/extras/9c11046c0b74afb5379004c135b5b187.webm?t=1774259042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836440/extras/9c11046c0b74afb5379004c135b5b187.mp4?t=1774259042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill out your <strong>logbook</strong> and figure out the <strong>mysteries of the world</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836440/extras/5a6b633928d68e581d8b8f41e910e5ad.poster.avif?t=1774259042\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836440/extras/5a6b633928d68e581d8b8f41e910e5ad.webm?t=1774259042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836440/extras/5a6b633928d68e581d8b8f41e910e5ad.mp4?t=1774259042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HEAVENSHATTER</strong> is a first-person 3d roguelike set in a distant post-post-post apocalyptic world, beyond matters and means. You are a mass of decaying limbs and microorganisms, emerged from the earth by a brutal, screeching roar. As you roam sandy desolate fields and ancient ruins, your goal is to charge two pillars to activate the great teleporter and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>artifacts</strong> from the creatures you kill and make yourself a <strong>horrific walking fortress</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836440/extras/dd917cfbba9b3fbc678f2d1caa